    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="f34797db-2401-5c69-8002-3c841683408c" activityNameId="df71baf7-8269-5de8-8b8a-82551cdff856" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Treatment of fuel cell balance of plant, 1MWe, SOEC</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Treatment of fuel cell balance of plant, 1MWe, SOEC
1 MW SOEC electrolyzer balance of plant end of life treatment, based on Niklas Gerloff, Comparative Life-Cycle-Assessment analysis of three major water electrolysis technologies while applying various energy scenarios for a greener hydrogen production, Journal of Energy Storage, Volume 43, 2021, https://doi.org/10.1/j.est0.20.1. For further secifications (e.g., efficiency, lifetime, etc.), refer to Sacchi, R. and Bauer, C. LCA of Power-to-X processes and applications in the residential sector. Paul Scherrer Institut, 2023.

 UUID: 3177ff73-0efc-4812-86c1-615b7857a763
Location: 
Technology: 
Time period: 
Production volume: 
Sampling: Sampling procedure: Literature data
Extrapolations: 
Uncertainty adjustments: 
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_3177ff73-0efc-4812-86c1-615b7857a763.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
